<title>FINLAND: Benefon 1996 profit falls 57 pct.</title>
<headline>Benefon 1996 profit falls 57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		    32 vs 74</p>
<p> Net sales					    284 -- down 6 pct</p>
<p> Operating profit				    28 vs 61</p>
<p>Benefon said the figures were preliminary.</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecasts for Finnish mobile phone maker Benefon Oy was for a 33 million markka profit</p>
</text>
